  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DBP Study visits</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The DBP Programme Bangladesh supports long-term, sustainable partnerships between Danish and Bangladeshi companies with a view to promoting local business development. The initial process starts with identification of suitable partners in both the countries. During this matchmaking process/identification, DBP offers advisory services and economic assistance. 
The matchmaking activities are approved and carried out in accordance with the overall DBP guideline. During 2014 , there were 37 study visits by Danish Companies. Out of which 7 companies had been decided to go further in to the preparation phase and form joint venture with Bangladeshi companies. The approved grant for study visits 2014 was DKK.723.340. The programme activity/visits has been completed.</narrative>
  </description>
